OL,3,GNEWSAWoman's early cancer symptoms
OL,4,Ablamed on menopause
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Kent woman diagnosed with blood
OL,7,Fcancer said symptoms she experienced
OL,8,Ffor years were initially put down to
OL,9,Fage and menopause.
OL,11,FSarah Chapman, from Maidstone, started
OL,12,Fto feel unusually tired in 2011, but it
OL,13,Fwas not until 2013 that doctors
OL,14,Fdiagnosed her with a condition that
OL,15,Flater developed into leukaemia.
OL,17,FThe retired audiologist and hockey
OL,18,Fumpire has shared her story in support
OL,19,Fof Blood Cancer Awareness Month and
OL,20,Fcharity Leukaemia UK to raise awareness
OL,21,Fof the signs and symptoms of the
OL,22,Fillness.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
